OL,3,GNEWSAWinter Olympian swapping bobsleigh
OL,4,Afor comedy
OL,5,
OL,6,FBobsleigh brakeman Greg Cackett is
OL,7,Fhoping to become the first UK Olympian
OL,8,Fto have a career in comedy.
OL,10,FCackett, who has been to three Winter
OL,11,FOlympics with Team GB, plans to retire
OL,12,Ffrom the sport this season.
OL,14,FHis passion away from the ice is
OL,15,Fwriting and this year he's taken part
OL,16,Fin several stand-up events.
OL,18,F"In my heart this chapter on sport is
OL,19,Fclosed and this new chapter with
OL,20,Fwriting, comedy, film and TV begins,"
OL,21,Fsaid Cackett.
